## Original Content
New fonts, better customization, and a whole new layout all make it worth dusting off your Instapaper account.

## Summary
Instapaper, a read-it-later app, has received a significant upgrade featuring new fonts, enhanced customization, and a redesigned layout. These improvements are intended to make the app more appealing and worth revisiting for users.

## Key Points
- New fonts have been introduced in Instapaper.
- The app now provides better customization options for users.
- A whole new layout has been implemented to improve usability.
- The upgrade makes it worthwhile for users to re-engage with Instapaper.


